prompts.props:
Use case: style-transfer
Asset type: transparent twelve-prop atlas in the NEW anime 3D JRPG art direction
Input roles: IMAGE 1 is our old prop sheet for OBJECT IDENTITIES AND GRID LAYOUT only. IMAGE 2 is the NEW JRPG town image for stylized geometry, painted colors, crisp shadows and material finish.
Primary request: recreate all TWELVE objects as original clean anime-JRPG 3D game assets, coherently belonging to the new town. Use constructed 3D shapes, crisp cel/toon-like light and shadow planes supported by gentle volume gradients, thin restrained dark contour accents, painted broad material colors, soft bevels and simplified grain. Remove photographic surface fuzz, tiny realistic fibers, clay-toy sheen and the brown studio glow. Palette: honey oak, cream, sage, deep teal, slate, terracotta and warm aged brass.
Exactly FOUR columns by THREE rows, every object isolated in its own cell with transparent space around it. Same elevated three-quarter camera, each item framed for readability, real-world scale not enforced across cells.
Row 1 left to right:
1 two-seat wooden slat bench, honey oak and deep teal metal frame;
2 sturdy two-person oak workshop table with lower shelf and empty working surface;
3 small round oak cafe table with a dark metal pedestal, no chairs attached;
4 one teal spindle-back cafe chair with an oak seat.
Row 2 left to right:
5 compact portable wooden radio with cream tuning panel, two knobs, woven speaker grille represented by a simple painted grid, curved brown handle;
6 small charcoal-and-silver camera with a round lens and neatly folded brown strap;
7 graphite over-ear headphones, broad headband and two clear cushions;
8 child's unfinished miniature town, three little houses with colored paper roofs on a small light-wood craft board.
Row 3 left to right:
9 cream ceramic plate holding three bread rolls;
10 sage-green ceramic mug;
11 small leafy plant in a terracotta pot with stylized grouped leaves;
12 signature tabletop hourglass, walnut top and base, three thin aged-brass pillars, hourglass-shaped glass vessel with narrow center neck, frosted upper chamber and clear lower chamber holding layers of ochre, terracotta, sage and teal sand. No magical glow or effects.
Background: genuine TRANSPARENT ALPHA behind all objects and in all gaps, preserve transparent glass and clean edge antialiasing. No colored studio wall or floor, no bokeh, no painted checkerboard, no paper texture, no caption panels, no heavy cast shadows outside object silhouettes.
Composition: wide landscape 3:2 production sheet, exactly twelve non-touching objects with full outlines visible and large gutters. No text, labels, grid lines, logos, branding or watermark.
